  <HPWC_Combat_Dismember.rulePack.rulesStrings>
    <li>r_logentry(recipient_part0_destroyed==True)->[INITIATOR_definite](이)가 [RECIPIENT_definite]의 [recipient_part0_label](을)를 뜯어냄.</li>
    <li>r_logentry(recipient_part0_destroyed==True)->[INITIATOR_definite](이)가 [RECIPIENT_definite]의 [recipient_part0_label](을)를 뽑아 버림.</li>
    <li>r_logentry(recipient_part0_destroyed==True,p=0.5)->[INITIATOR_definite](이)가 [RECIPIENT_definite](을)를 붙잡고 [recipient_part0_label](을)를 뜯어냄.</li>
    <li>r_logentry(recipient_part0_destroyed==False)->[INITIATOR_definite](이)가 [RECIPIENT_definite]의 [recipient_part0_label](을)를 뜯어내려 했지만 상처만 입힘.</li>
    <li>r_logentry(recipient_part0_destroyed==False)->[INITIATOR_definite](이)가 [RECIPIENT_definite]의 [recipient_part0_label](을)를 잡아 뜯어 상처를 입힘.</li>
    <li>r_logentry(recipient_part0_destroyed==False,p=0.5)->[INITIATOR_definite](이)가 [RECIPIENT_definite]의 [recipient_part0_label](을)를 뽑아 버리려 했지만 떨어지지 않음.</li>
  </HPWC_Combat_Dismember.rulePack.rulesStrings>

